    "examples": "[{\"input\":\"beginWord = \\\"hit\\\", endWord = \\\"cog\\\", wordList = [\\\"hot\\\",\\\"dot\\\",\\\"dog\\\",\\\"lot\\\",\\\"log\\\",\\\"cog\\\"]\",\"output\":\"5\",\"explanation\":\"One shortest transformation sequence is \\\"hit\\\" -> \\\"hot\\\" -> \\\"dot\\\" -> \\\"dog\\\" -> \\\"cog\\\", which is 5 words long.\"},{\"input\":\"beginWord = \\\"hit\\\", endWord = \\\"cog\\\", wordList = [\\\"hot\\\",\\\"dot\\\",\\\"dog\\\",\\\"lot\\\",\\\"log\\\"]\",\"output\":\"0\",\"explanation\":\"The endWord \\\"cog\\\" is not in wordList.\"}]",
