    "examples": "[{\"input\":\"num1 = \\\"2\\\", num2 = \\\"3\\\"\",\"output\":\"\\\"6\\\"\",\"explanation\":\"2 * 3 = 6.\"},{\"input\":\"num1 = \\\"123\\\", num2 = \\\"456\\\"\",\"output\":\"\\\"56088\\\"\",\"explanation\":\"123 * 456 = 56088.\"}]",
